---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Remove Blur Online"
  description="Remove Blur Online terms and conditions. Free online photo unblurring service. Use at your own risk; all processing is client-side and private."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[12px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8f8f8f] shadow-whisper mx-auto mb-6">
      Terms and Conditions
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-6 leading-tight">
      Terms and Conditions
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[15px] sm:text-lg text-[#4d4d4d] max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Last updated: October 27, 2026
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Welcome to Remove Blur Online (removebluronline.com). These terms govern your use of our free online photo unblurring
      service. By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          1. Use of the Service
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Remove Blur Online is provided free of charge for personal, non-commercial use. You may upload, sharpen, and download
          images you own or have the right to process. You agree not to use the service to process illegal content, content you do
          not own or have rights to, or content that violates any applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          2. No Account Required
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          No registration, email address, or account is required to use Remove Blur Online. You may use the tool anonymously and
          without providing any personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          3. Client-Side Processing
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          All image processing is performed locally in your web browser using HTML5 Canvas. Your photos are not uploaded to our
          servers, are not stored by us, and are not accessible to anyone else. You are responsible for the images you choose to
          process and for downloading your results before closing the browser tab.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          4. No Warranty
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Remove Blur Online is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not
          guarantee that every blur can be removed, that results will be perfect, or that the service will be uninterrupted or
          error-free. Image restoration quality depends on the source photo and blur type.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          5. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Remove Blur Online and its operators are not liable for any indirect, incidental,
          special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of data, profits, or use, arising out of or related to your
          use of the service, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          6. Intellectual Property
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Between you and Remove Blur Online, you retain all rights to the images you upload and the results you generate. We do
          not claim ownership of your photos, and we do not store or reuse them. The site design, code, and branding are owned by
          Remove Blur Online and may not be copied or reused without permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          7. Termination
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We may suspend or terminate access to the service at any time, without notice, for any reason, including violation of
          these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          8. Changes to These Terms
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We may update these terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date reflects the most recent revision. Your continued
          use of Remove Blur Online after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          9. Governing Law
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          These terms are governed by the laws applicable to removebluronline.com, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          10. Contact
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about these terms, please contact us via our
          <a href="/contact-us" class="text-[#0070f3] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#0761d1] transition-colors">Contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-[#ebebeb] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-[#8f8f8f]">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#171717] text-white text-[14px] font-medium shadow-whisper hover:bg-black transition-all active:scale-[0.98]"
      >
        ← Back to Unblur Tool
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
